r/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"City Craft\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Upcycle\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Lexicon\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Nexus\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Block Detective\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Suspicious Pots\" width=\"85\"></a></p>\n\nСодержание относится к модам, ресурс-пакам, модпакам или шейдерам для Minecraft, а также другим связанным с Minecraft ресурсам. Пожалуйста, сохраняйте стиль языка приятным для геймеров.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"message\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/